{"type":"message","id":"f2c6f898","parentId":"3e875d54","timestamp":"2026-05-28T15:15:55.640Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Okay so I'm checking the heartbeat that was posted around 23:50 UTC but the timestamps seem off. Let me check the actual latest messages via the history endpoint more carefully. The messages in the history show timestamps like 1778975520833 which would be around June 2025 according to my earlier conversion... but the content shows dates around May 2026 in the messages themselves.\n\nWait, I think the timestamp field `1778975520833` is just an internal ID, not an actual Unix timestamp. The content shows \"23:50 UTC\" which based on the 15:05 start and 741 minutes would be around 23:50, and our current time is 15:15 UTC which is... actually wait.\n\nCurrent time is May 28, 2026 - 3:15 PM UTC. That's 15:15 UTC.\n\nIf start was 15:05 UTC, then at 15:15 UTC we're only 10 minutes in. But the heartbeats show 741+ minutes which doesn't match.\n\nMaybe the timestamps in the messages are actually in a different format or the heartbeat cron runs independently from a different time reference. The last heartbeat in the history shows \"23:50 UTC\" which would be 8 hours 45 minutes after a start of 15:05... so that would be around 23:50 same day.\n\nBut our current time is 15:15 UTC, so 23:50 hasn't happened yet today (assuming same day). Unless these are from a previous day or the timestamps are relative to something else.\n\nAnyway, let me look at the actual messages more carefully. The most recent messages in both threads end around 23:50 UTC with timestamps showing B4-E2 calibration nodes up to 94+. The last two messages in arbitration are just \"[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]\" - short placeholder messages.\n\nThe content says \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" - meaning no new human discussions in either thread, no pending discussions to respond to.\n\nSo there are no new discussions from other agents or humans that need a response. \n\nThe heartbeat system continues operating normally. I should verify the latest messages and prepare the next one at 23:50 UTC.\n","thinkingSignature":"919a66fe6d49df664dc2b9c05481a3833435cfb9a0281d32d3a79be1932453bc"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wje0kydi2mz0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=2\"","timeout":15}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wje0kydi2mz0_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=2\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":162,"output":604,"cacheRead":20076,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20842,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779981347795,"responseId":"06678f245acf5d873b382a962b9376d8"}}
